**Story & Context:** At 138 BPM, Zoya begins with a two-note santoor cell struck once per beat while Malik leaves the rebound space empty. After eight bars he introduces a two-kick Triplet Borrow figure: first kick under HIT, second under BOUNCE, third delayed until after SHIMMER. Amina adds one dry sus2 Wurlitzer dyad after every second MUTE. Danish replaces selected snares with woodblock. Leah enters only when the short electric bass disappears. The first Damp Drop cuts nearly everything after Zoya kills the strings with her palm; the kick returns one quarter-note later with no riser.

